Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:05.98,title2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\pos(986.8,1045.4)\fad(376,0)}愛思特的照護
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:05.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(986,1044.267)\fad(376,0)}愛思特的照護
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神人 沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛思特
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:22.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我為神人煮了粥哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 謝啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盯～
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛思特？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請張開嘴 神人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊地張開嘴 神人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.91,0:00:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…不 我能自己吃 能不能把勺子給我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.41,0:00:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:49.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.28,0:00:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:00:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,燙…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:01.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神人 請不要動
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然瞄不準呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.38,0:01:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神人 請快點張開嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:11.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}好燙…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛思特 應該放涼點才能細心品嚐呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.46,0:01:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.11,0:01:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你… 你在做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.67,0:01:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說感冒的時候 用人的體溫傳熱會奏效
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.44,0:01:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽誰說的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖說我能猜個大概
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神人 請老實呆著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:54.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感冒會傳給你的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:57.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精靈是不會感冒的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:05.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為啥拿著蔥…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神人 請把屁股露出來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.13,0:02:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁…？ 為什麼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.17,0:02:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琳絲蕾告訴我的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要將這蔥插進神人的屁股 感冒就會好轉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種詭異感爆棚的民間療法是什麼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.26,0:02:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這絕對不是對的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.94,0:02:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不能逃 神人！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神人 請把屁股露出來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.24,0:02:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對… 請住手！
